% Rule "TurnSprinklerOn"; its Java, not translated: System.out.println( "Turn on the sprinkler for room " + f.getRoom().getName() );
if there is a sprinkler in a room
    and it is not the case that the sprinkler in the room is on
    and there is a fire in the room
then the sprinkler in the room turns on.

when the sprinkler in a room turns on
then the sprinkler in the room is on.

% Rule "TurnSprinklerOff"; its Java, not translated: System.out.println( "Turn off the sprinkler for room " + s.getRoom().getName() );
if the sprinkler in a room is on
    and it is not the case that there is a fire in the room
then the sprinkler in the room turns off.

when the sprinkler in a room turns off
then it is not the case that the sprinkler in the room is on.

